      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Preliminary evidence: TZDs and vit E can help correct biochem and histologic abnormalities but may ⍉reduce fibrosis; vit E (800 IU/day) suggested for nondiabetic MASH w stage 2+ fibrosis."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
